    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Butter chicken serves 4 and takes about 65 minutes plus marinating. The chicken needs at least an hour in the yoghurt, so start there. Watch the sauce so it does not catch and burn."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Blend the sauce until truly smooth for that glossy restaurant finish."
          }
        ]
      },
